<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 15/16.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 15/16.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April 15/16 at 1000GMT. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	   April 15/16   April 14/15</p>
<p> CZK	0.45011	 0.4584</p>
<p> DKK	2.099	   2.09952</p>
<p> FIM	2.67621	 2.67786</p>
<p> HUF	0.07637	 0.07633</p>
<p> JPY	0.10963	 0.10899</p>
<p> LTL	3.45986	 3.4449</p>
<p> LVL     23.65533	23.58915</p>
<p> RUR	0.00241	 0.0024</p>
<p> SEK	1.79916	 1.80505</p>
<p> UAH	7.48539	 7.44743</p>
<p> USD     13.836	  13.7796</p>
<p> XEU     15.63676	15.62676</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
